      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Still occurs in live build. This also applies all other types of constraints, as I've used constraints directly on a Physbone chain, which in theory would function similarly to animating it, but it resulted in the physbone continuing to \"simulate\", despite the fact that it was rotation locked, affecting its colliders and physics.",
